nt-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일반적 장학조건</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">생활비 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">수업료는 면제 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">특별한 경우 본인 부담</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">※ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">스위스 주립대학과 취리히 공대는 장학생의 경우 대학에서 수업료를 면제함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">※ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">대학원 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">MBA</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">과정이나 단기예술과정은 수업료가 면제되지 않는 경우가 종종 있음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">※ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">특수 대학원인 경우 수업료가 연간 약 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">40,000 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">스위스 프랑인 곳도 있음 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"L